window.products.push({"id":988162,"name":"PuzFun Christmas Decorations 3Pcs Christmas Gnomes Plush Handmade Winter Holiday Gnomes Tomte Plush Decorations Sled Santa Claus Home Ornaments Tablet","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71H8bn77LIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"❄️【Christmas Decorations】- Gnome, also known as a Tomte or Nisse, short plush beard, go particularly well with your festive decorations.They are well known as guarding earthly treasures providing good luck and are perfect for protecting your Christmas goodies.Add some mystical enchantment to your holiday decor with this charming gnome. 🔔【Handmade Material 】- the lucky santa gnome set is made of reliable felt or knitted fabric and the artificial beard is made of fiber faux fur, which is very smooth and comfortable. Christmas design adds festive atmosphere. Each Gnome is unique and all handmade with love. ⛄️【Adorable Size】- Each package includes 3 winter gnomes. It's perfect home ornament to place them in your living room, like the desk, sofa, bookcase, shelf, dining table, and bed. 🎈【Ideal Xmas/Holiday Gift】- Your families or friends will be so surprised with these cute elf gnomes. It makes a great gift and can be displayed anywhere in the home. The reindeer horn designs and bright colors must make a perfect addition to the home. 🎁【Great Holiday Decorations】-In folklore, the gnome brings good luck to families and is regarded as good luck. It is perfect to decorate your tiered tray, desk, table, sofa, bookcase, shelf or a special place in your home. Let the whole house full of christmas/Xmas holiday festive atmosphere.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71H8bn77LIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PuzFun","source_asin":"B09F98GF1C","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-988162","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09F98GF1C","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09F98GF1C","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":988163,"name":"Bobolyn Ceramic Electric Wax Melt Warmer - Candle Wax Warmer Burner Melt Wax Cube Melter Fragrance Warmer - Ideal Gift for Wedding Spa and Aromatherap","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":774.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61d7ldhNh6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【64 items in 1 package】CERAMIC HALO CARVED DESIGN - Place this stunning wax melter warmer on the shelf, table, or desk in your home or office with traditional or contemporary style to add a decorative touch as well as a lovely scent. This wax melter burner looks really cosy in the corner of the room with its subtle light, will definitely highlight your space. EASY AND SAFE OPERATION - Simply plug-in power, turn on the switch. The soft glow of the warming bulb will give off a subtle scent, without flame, soot, or other pollutants. The wax warmer/burner provides a safe, clean and efficient way to melt your scented wax melts. No need to keep watch over, safe around children and pets. ELIMINATE UNPLEASANT ODOR - This ceramic oil warmer can help mask unpleasant odors while replacing it with a warm inviting aroma, creating a pleasing and romantic atmosphere when you are working, meeting, reading, sleeping, exercising. Choose your favourite scent to create a seasonal ambience. SUPERIOR QUALITY & MATERIAL - The electric oil burner melts aroma wax tarts and fragrances candles rapidly and produces a good amount of scent whilst also illuminating the burner with a nice warm glow. And the fragrance can last longer to save wax tarts. This electric wax burner does not get too hot like some warmers that leave a burning smell. A detachable wax container is easy to clean. ENJOY LIFE AND EXPRESS GRATITUDE - It is a good choice to use this lovely fragrance warmer melter as a gift to the elders, loved ones, friends, and kids. Share happiness and express gratitude with it on Valentine's Day, Christmas Day, birthdays, anniversaries, holidays, Teachers' Day, Father's Day, Mother's Day, and more.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61d7ldhNh6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bobolyn","source_asin":"B0BWMCPQCK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-988163","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BWMCPQCK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BWMCPQCK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
