window.products.push({"id":988200,"name":"Nuwave OxyPure ZERO E500 Smart Air Purifier, ZERO Waste & ZERO Filter Replacements Large Area up to 855 Sq Ft, Captures 100% of Particle Pollutants as","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":349.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51B2FEaYY2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"INDOOR AIR POLLUTION - EPA estimates that the air indoors can be as much as 5 TIMES more polluted than outdoors. If you suffer from fatigue, headaches, congestion, coughing, and sneezing, you may be exposed to poor air quality conditions in the home. PURIFY LARGE AREA UP TO 855 SQ FT - Unseen to the naked eye, you may unwittingly be inhaling billions of unseen pollutants and allergens into your lungs with every breath you take. OxyPure is proven to effectively purify a 420 sq. ft room 2 x per hour and an 855 sq. ft room 1 x per hour. INTERTEK LAB CERTIFIED – E500 captures 100% of airborne particle pollutants as small as 0.1 microns including smoke, dust, and pollen. It removes airborne viruses, pollen, mold spores, dust, bacteria, pet dander, harmful chemicals, allergens, and Ozone. DUAL 3-STAGE FILTERATION – 2 Stainless-steel prefilter captures large particles & allergens. 2 Hi-Tech Bio-Guard Filters & 1 Bio-Guard 360 Filter remove harmful airborne particle pollutants and odors. REVOLUTIONARY FILTER TECHNOLOGY – Just like the vacuum cleaners did away with paper filters, OxyPure E500 does away with paper filters. The ultra-effective Bio-Guard filters are washable and reusable meaning ZERO waste and ZERO filter replacements. CALIFORNIA AIR RESOURCE BOARD CERTIFIED – OxyPure E500 meets the stringent California ozone emissions limit. It eliminates toxic Ozone in the home to less than 1 part per billion (ppb) about 70 times less than the EPA’s designated safe level of 70 ppb. ENERGY STAR CERTIFIED – Even when operating 24/7, the annual electricity cost is less than $10! Check with your local utility company to determine if a portion of the purchase qualifies for a rebate. It is also FCC and ETL certified. SMART DEVICE & WIFI CAPABLE – OxyPure E500 is WIFI capable. You can connect remotely to monitor and control the air quality in your home anytime, anywhere from an app on your phone. The app is compatible with both Android and i-Phones. ALLERGY RELIEF & BETTER SLEEP – National Sleep Foundation found that sleep is dramatically impaired by allergy symptoms. OxyPure promotes better sleep by eliminating airborne allergens that can irritate the sinuses, nasal passages, and lungs. WHAT’S INCLUDED – 2 stainless-steel pre-filters, 2 Bio-Guard filters, 1 Bio-Guard 360 Filter, and 1 owner’s manual. All filters are washable and reusable. Expected life span is 20 years.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51B2FEaYY2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Nuwave","source_asin":"B0BJ37H5RG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-988200","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BJ37H5RG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BJ37H5RG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
