window.products.push({"id":988255,"name":"Red Barn Winter by Debbi Wetzel, 30x47-Inch Canvas Wall Art","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":72.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71wF8huG4UL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"This ready to hang, gallery-wrapped art piece features a large red barn covered in snow in the center of the frame. Debbi Wetzeli1/2s studio overlooks a seasonally changing landscape in the Green Mountains of Vermont. Small village life with pumpkins on front porch, church steeples and crows in the cornfield are what inspire her work. Introduced to acrylics in the 70i1/2s, Debbi has found her own way around the medium, and painted on broken pieces of Vermont roofing shingle slate, antique wooden boxes and furniture and has now evolved into canvas originals . Bright , bold colors and sharp lines define the fall foliage, county architecture and telling the story of the countryside that Debbi likes to share in her paintings. Small details such as the pattern on the hanging quilt ,fireflies in the nighttime sky, or the trick or treat parade in the village are fun to investigate. Woodzels by Wetzels is the collaboration of husband Adam and Debbi doing art and craft shows for the past 40 years. Now teaching her grandchildren the fun of painting and the adventure of travel. Giclee (jee-clay) is an advanced printmaking process for creating high quality fine art reproductions. The attainable excellence that Giclee printmaking affords makes the reproduction virtually indistinguishable from the original piece. The result is wide acceptance of Giclee by galleries, museums, and private collectors. Gallery wrap is a method of stretching an artist's canvas so that the canvas wraps around the sides and is secured a hidden, wooden frame. This method of stretching and preparing a canvas allows for a frameless presentation of the finished painting.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71wF8huG4UL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Trademark Fine Art","source_asin":"B071GRGQPK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-988255","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B071GRGQPK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B071GRGQPK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
