window.products.push({"id":988500,"name":"Lotmat Tablecloth Plaid Jacquard Waterproof Wrinkle Free Polyester Rectangular Long Functional Tabletop Cover for Family Meals, Thanksgiving, Festival","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61HSjXaIN9L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Material: Polyester Jacquard fabric, simple and luxurious diamond pattern design brings a noble and warm look without losing it’s functionality. The rectangle tablecloth has a good decorative effect and can be oil-proof, wrinkle free, washable. How to Choose: 52×70In(for seats of 4). 60×84In(for seats of 4-6). 60×104In(for seats of 6-8). 60×120In(for seats of 10-12). The perfect drop length is each length of 8~12IN(Table)/4~8IN(Tea Table). Referenced Formula: ①Tablecloth=You table length + perfect each pendulous length(8~12IN) ×2. ②Tea Tablecloth = Tea Table Length + each end drops(4~8IN)×2. Keep the length of the recommended pendulous length within this range will achieve best decoration and protection effect. Using table cloth creates a wonderful and luxurious setting for your family and friends to enjoy together. Perfect Table Decor: There are 3 style of tablecloth to choose from: Diamond, Plaid, Stripe. Diverse Jacquard Pattern Design meets your needs of daily use, activities, holiday, picnic, patio, wedding banquet, birthday party, family meals, festival: Christmas, Thanksgiving. Rectangle Table Cloth suits for restaurant, dinning table, family room, tea table, cafe, buffet, gardens. About Us: Lotmat Fashion Home inspired by Entry Lux, Chic, Modern Style, striving to provide satisfying textile products and serve. If there are any questions or needs, please feel free to contact with us.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61HSjXaIN9L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lotmat","source_asin":"B07XWW565L","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-988500","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07XWW565L","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07XWW565L","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
