window.products.push({"id":988579,"name":"EAARSUO 6 Pcs Multifunction Razor Holder for Shower Wall, Silicone Self Adhesive Hooks for Hanging, Waterproof Damage Free Hanging Hooks, Stick on Wal","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61d5L3288wL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【4 Legs Design】: Our adhesive hooks are designed with 4 legs, which can make the silicone hooks firmly clamp the object, making it stable and not easy to fall off. You can hang various small objects, saving space for your home. Besides, the razor holder for shower adapts a smooth round head design, which allows you to safely hang your items without worrying about hurting your hands or the surface of your items. 【Silicone Material】: The adhesive wall hooks is made of high-quality silicone material, which is waterproof and rustproof. You can use it with confidence even in wet environments such as showers, bathrooms, kitchens, etc. At the same time, our hooks are wear-resistant and not easy to fade, which ensures its long service life. 【Multifunctional hook】: The sticky hooks for hanging can be used for various daily use. It can be used in any scenario such as bathroom, kitchen, bedroom, office, etc. You can hang toothbrushes, towels, keys, plugs, cables, kitchen utensils and more. This can save storage space for you, and keeps items organized and eliminates clutter. 【Easy to Install】: No drilling, no tools required, just peel off the protective layer on the back, you can stick the hooks for shower wall to any smooth surface. The hook has strong stickiness and high load capacity. It's easy to remove, won't damage your walls, and no longer leaves unsightly marks on your walls. 【Installation Matters】：This wall hanging hooks is only applicable to smooth surfaces, such as marble, mirror, glass and any other metal materials. It is not suitable for lime walls, rusted metal, painted walls, wallpaper or uneven rough surface surfaces. Please clean the dirt on the surface before paste. After pasting, leave it for 24 hours before use.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61d5L3288wL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"EAARSUO","source_asin":"B0BBZ1W12J","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-988579","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BBZ1W12J","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BBZ1W12J","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
