window.products.push({"id":988794,"name":"Leifheit 6 Pack Clear Reusable Glass Bottles with Shackle Lock Stopper","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81hf3yBgk7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Finally, a stylish way to store homemade elderberry syrup, prepared black current Liqueur and freshly squeezed Orange juicer Leifheit glass bottles enrich each table with its high-quality faceting and are a real eye-catcher with their stylish wire swing-top. The swing-top not only looks attractive but its porcelain head and rubber ring seals the bottle securely, allowing the content to be stored well and hygienically. The practical portion-sized bottles (0. 5 liter) are also great for storing or portioning vinegar and oil. Particularly practical: the bottles can be washed simply and easily in the dishwasher.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81hf3yBgk7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Leifheit","source_asin":"B07VLC537X","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-988794","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07VLC537X","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07VLC537X","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
