window.products.push({"id":988933,"name":"Whisky Stones Stainless Steel Footballs Set of 6 in a Luxury Box. Reusable Chilling Rocks Stone Ice Cubes Beer, Wine Chillers. Cool Birthday Gift Sets","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/713zbwYJhAL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"❤️ BEAUTIFUL AND CLASSY LOOK: These stainless steel whiskey footballs are meant to be used to chill and cool your drink adding a little rebellion spirit and special atmosphere to your occasion. It is a great novelty item and a perfect conversation starter for any place. The set includes 6 stainless steel football-shaped whiskey rocks, tongs, luxury paper box and branded velvet pouch. 🍴 SAFETY AND HONESTY FIRST: The whiskey footballs ice cubes are made from 304 Food grade stainless steel sealed by welding. One football contains approximately 95% purified water, 5% alcohol. We must say that they are not better or as good as ice so please, put more footballs for the same results. WARNING!: DO NOT SWALLOW! DO NOT BOIL OR MICROWAVE! 👍 BLOW DILUTION AWAY: The stainless steel whiskey rocks footballs (rugby balls) will not dilute your beverage with water while keeping it cool. You should put them for at least a few hours in a freezer, put them in your liquor and enjoy a cooling drink for about an hour. If you like it very cold please use all the six footballs, for mild cold you can use 4. 🍸 UNIQUE DRINKING EXPERIENCE: Make your drinking experience special every time. Whether you celebrate or just have fun with friends you can add a little special flavor with details like these cool-looking whiskey accessories. We believe that details are everything when it comes to creating an atmosphere and we pay attention to them as well. 🎁 PERFECT GIFT: The chilling whiskey rugby balls are a great gift for all occasions, all seasons, and all people, who enjoy life, love the special atmosphere, like cool staff, appreciate family and friends, and want to add some adventurer spirit to their life.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/713zbwYJhAL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TANGRA","source_asin":"B078JRMN6F","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-988933","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B078JRMN6F","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B078JRMN6F","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
